2 CONC t Samsing (born Hemmingsdatter) Husband: Christian Jeppesen Children: ...sdatter), Jeppe Christiansen, Hemming Christiansen, Anne Madsen (born Christiansdatter), Bodil Cathrine Hansen (born Christiansdatter), K...
