2 CONT Barbara Gjødesdatter Født: Omk  i Bjerregaard, Åle sogn, Skanderborg amt Død: Omk 1580 i Oustrupgaard, Røgen sogn Stilling: Grdmdskone på Oustrupgård Ref: B6609s Note: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Barbara blev gift med Anders Lauritsen Bonde, herredsfoged og gårdejer på Oustrupgård. Han er født omkr. 1520 i Farre sogn. Kilde: 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://brindt.dk/erik_brindt/544.htm Barbara blev gift med Herredsfoged Anders Lauridsen Bonde, søn af Laurits Sejersen og Kirsten Nielsdatter. (Herredsfoged Anders Lauridsen Bonde blev født i 1520 i Oustrupgaard, Røgen Sogn, Skan
2 CONC derborg Amt 1, døbt i 1520, døde den 6 September 1598 i Oustrupgaard, Røgen Sogn, Skanderborg Amt og blev begravet i September 1598 i Røgen Kirke, Skanderborg Amt.)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Notes: Source: CD bought by Kirstin and Bjarne Nørgaard-Pedersen works Herreds THINGS BOOKS 1662 - 1681  8.5 1680. (15) 
2 CONT
2 CONT ** Laurids Andersen Bonde in Sorring did read one county letter, dated 17/3 1582, REFERENCE samfrændeskifte 09.20 1580 in Ovstrup after beating Anders Bonde and Barbara Fertilize daughter between their children Sejer Andersen Laur
2 CONC ids Andersen and Niels Knudsen in Havreballeskov the hustru Margrete Andersdatters behalf. samfrænderne Anders Bonde in Spettrup, Jamie Green in the head, Jørgen Mogensen in Sael, Anders Mogensen in Farre, Jens Mikkelsen Skjoldele
2 CONC v, Anders Knudsen Vengegård, Erik Pedersen in Farre, Jens Jonsen in Overgaard, Søren Lauridsen in Mollerup, Iver Lauridsen Sorring, Rasmus Lauridsen sst and Mogens Andersen in Farre. 
2 CONT ********************************** 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ........C3. Barbara Gjødesdatter, f. ca. ca. 1525; 1g. Peder Braad i Oustrup, jvf.
2 CONT ............Claus Glambek?s brevkiste 11.01.1580; 2g. Anders Lauritsen Bonde,
2 CONT ............herredsfoged i Gjern Herred, f. Farre Sogn i Gjern Herred 1520 , d.
2 CONT ............Oustrupgård i Røgen Sogn 1580 (1g. Karen Lauridsdatter Sejersen)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://forum.slaegt.dk/index.php?topic=60359.0
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Maren Andersdatter  Her Parents: no. 8192-4950  tip-10-grandparents:  16384-9899.  Anders Lauritsen Bonde  Born in 1520 in Oustrupgård by smoke, died in 1580 the same place.  Mounting Bonde under the crown of smoke, herredsfoged i
2 CONC n works township.  Married second time with Barbara Gjødesdatter, born 1525, died ca. 1580, daughter of herredsfoged in Vrads-Tyrsting Gjøde Eriksen.  Married  16384-9900. Karen Lauritsdatter Sejersen  Born 1525,  died about 1564.
2 CONC   other children in this marriage:  Sejer Andersen Bonde (ca. 1540-98), bailiff in Skanderborg and farm fasten his father, married to Johanne Grøn;  Laurits Andersen Bonde (about 1540-).  Margrethe Andersdatter, married to Niels K
2 CONC nudsen in "Haffuersballe" farm in Kragelund 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:  "The family Meldgaard from Haarup, Linaa parish" (Nordic Genealogy, Skals 1969)  Kirstin Nørgaard Pedersen: "District Bailiff race" Volume I (publisher genus)  "Danish Castles and Manors "(Hassing Publishing 1968)  J. Ki
2 CONC nch:" Ribe town's history and description "Volume 2  Carl Langholz:" Ancestor of famous Danes "Volume 1 (Lyngby 1989) 
