2 CONT 12 Apr 1738 - Dorthe Mariche Bang 
2 CONT
2 CONT 09 Mar 1739 - Jacob Bang 
2 CONT
2 CONT 17?? - Hans Bang 
2 CONT
2 CONT 21 Okt 1744 - Peder Schwane Bang
