1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *  13. 21/12 1787 [p. Cap. Gudum-F. 16/8 80, o. 11/10; Fred. Trin. K.-V. 3/6 83] Daniel Haar (Haahr); [15/1 1796 Spjellerup-S.; see der].
