2 CONT ==Anders Lauridsen Bonde, Oustrupgaard==
2 CONT
2 CONT Title of Nobility: District Judge
2 CONT
2 CONT Residing in Sorring in Dallerup Sogn, later crowned in the farm Oustrup in Røgen Sogn and herredsfoged in Gjern Herred
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Karen Lauritsdatter Sejersen Circa 1530
2 CONT
2 CONT Married:  Barbara Gødesdatter Circa 1565
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: 	Inger Pedersdatter Rhode
2 CONT
