2 CONC visionsudvalget for tyske betalinger. 1949-52 Assistant statistician i World Health Organisation (WHO), Tuberculosis Research Office i Helsingfors. 1952-55 Statistician i WHO Eastern Mediterranean Regional Office i Alexandria. 195
