2 CONT Dorothea Severinsdatter Langmose Ytzen
2 CONT '''Born''' about 1545 in Langmose, Halk, Haderslev, Haderslev, Denmark
2 CONT Daughter of Severin von Ytzen and Dorothea
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Wife''' of Matthias Beyerholm Voeth 
2 CONT Mother of Jacob Beyerholm Voeth
2 CONT '''Died''' in Bejerholm, Halk, Haderslev, Haderslev, Danmark
2 CONT
2 CONT Baronesse Dorothea Severinsdatter Langmose Ytzen was''' born about 1545''' in Langmose, Halk, Haderslev Amt, Danmark, to Severin and Dorothea Langmose Ytzen.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Dorothea Severinsdatter Langmose Ytzen and Mathias Beyerholm Voeth are :
2 CONT
2 CONT Mette Matthiasdatter Voeth (-aft.1605) 
2 CONT Hans "Reverholm" Beyerholm-Voeth, Gårdmand (1570, Beyerholm, Halk, Haderslev–1597 or 1598, Halk, Haderslev
2 CONT Jacob Beyerholm-Voeth, also known as Jacob Ytzen (?–1620), Later "husfoged", Bordeholm; "Sheriff" in Kropp 
2 CONT
2 CONT
